 223:Src/transport/usb/usb_board_link.cpp ****     // SELECT_ROLE write it cannot be a role response. Leave it untouched and
 224:Src/transport/usb/usb_board_link.cpp ****     // let the bounded bootstrap retry observe its release before sending.
